"https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820496_1089894899818270_7788847896725370154_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ExJZ1AqjGN8Q7kNvwGr24Q1&_nc_oc=Adrf7qFJUrYVA2NAV7AWRB7HScgwVFq2kXmNy64MwRAG7jMy7lwL5DNXkzQ_bywfODg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNHxS330tI6AW8iUxshNcFjKoYe6eV53iqxBQkB3WXs0w&oe=6AE35ECA"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot - Jeff Winner Pose.png", "id": "1835736590637012", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_1835736593970345_9165624188310989171_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rFJpQVzQZ_YQ7kNvwGPhEMW&_nc_oc=AdorCQfrw5CK-mfkOhWslB9c9gn8Rh6dmVZWor29YR0v182IC0wdO_acqCtZUCw06Sw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMifM8owltcj5M-fusE8DP2DujF7R_UbfJgWvJZIjmdcg&oe=6AE36629"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Nora Lyra Ferotron D-topaz-denoise-enhance-faceai.png", "id": "1984921442068353", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820566_1984921445401686_5331445718030399366_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8kRekXcPDqoQ7kNvwEtrgMe&_nc_oc=Ado_HDf_HT78yynZRBIwSh2EnQcBpNcBT_OwSFGSWwrMeo3eqLjYoI0JJ8HSx7mfc3E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMXl0w5lpC7V1uMYlWrqJU9hFIXuLczpke9G-sZRH9LkQ&oe=6AE3426F"}, "display_name": "Big Bang Ball", "keywords": ["Racket", "Arcade", "Sports", "Tennis", "Scifi"], "long_description": "**-> Update: Multiplayer!** Invite a friend and show them who owns the arena!\n\nBig Bang Ball is an intense, futuristic VR sports experience that blends the spirit of paddle tennis with the thrill of explosive sci-fi battles.  \nYou play from a first-person perspective, wielding an energy paddle to launch, curve, and deflect a glowing plasma ball toward your opponent\u2019s goal. The catch? The ball can explode and timing is everything. Use power-ups, shield bursts, and trick shots to dominate fast-paced matches where skill and reflexes decide everything.\n\nTravel through a series of themed worlds,  from the golden desert of Pyramidia to the icy peaks of Frosthelm, each with unique arenas, opponents, and challenges. Commander Noelle guides you through your journey as you climb the ranks to become the ultimate Big Bang Ball Champion. \n\nDesigned for Meta Quest, Big Bang Ball is easy to pick up, full of energy, and built to make you move. Whether you\u2019re training solo or (coming soon) battling friends online, it\u2019s the ultimate mix of sport, sci-fi, and spectacle.\n\n**Move fast. Hit hard. Don\u2019t let the ball explode!**", "short_description": "-> Update: Multiplayer! Invite a friend and show them who owns the arena!\n\nStep into the arena of the future! Big Bang Ball is a fast-paced VR sport that fuses paddle tennis with explosive sci-fi action. Deflect, charge, and smash an energy ball through your opponent\u2019s goal while dodging power-ups and chaos. Easy to learn, hard to master - and impossible to stand still!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1526621458784657", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Big Bang Ball", "keywords": ["Schl\u00e4ger", "Arcade", "Sport", "Tennis", "Scifi"], "long_description": "**-> Update: Multiplayer!** Zeig Deinen Freunden, wo der Hammer h\u00e4ngt!\n\nBig Bang Ball ist ein intensives, futuristisches VR-Sporterlebnis, das Elemente aus Paddle-Tennis mit explosiver Sci-Fi-Action verbindet. Du schl\u00e4gst mit deinen Energie-Schl\u00e4gern einen leuchtenden Plasmaball ins gegnerische Tor, am besten \u00fcber Bande oder mit Effet, und wehrst scharfe Sch\u00fcsse ab. Doch Vorsicht: Der Ball kann explodieren \u2013 auf's richtige Timing kommt es an. Nutze Power-ups und raffinierte Trickshots, um die rasanten Matches f\u00fcr Dich zu entscheiden. Geschick und Reaktionsverm\u00f6gen machen den Unterschied!\n\nReise durch abwechslungsreiche Welten \u2013 von der goldenen W\u00fcste Pyramidias bis zu den eisigen Gipfeln von Frosthelm. Jede Welt bietet eigene Arenen, Gegner und Herausforderungen. Commander Noelle begleitet Dich auf deinem Weg zum ultimativen Big Bang Ball Champion.\n\nBig Bang Ball wurde speziell f\u00fcr Meta Quest entwickelt: leicht zu erlernen, voller Energie und eher nicht im Sitzen zu spielen. Egal ob Du allein trainierst oder online gegen Freunde antrittst \u2013 hier treffen Sport, Science-Fiction und Action aufeinander.\n\n**Sei schnell. Schlage hart. Und lass den Ball nicht explodieren!**", "short_description": "-> Update: Multiplayer! Zeig Deinen Freunden, wo der Hammer h\u00e4ngt!\n\nHereinspaziert in die Arena der Zukunft! Big Bang Ball ist ein rasantes VR-Sportspiel, das Paddle-Tennis mit explosiver Sci-Fi-Action verbindet. Wehre Angriffe ab und schmettere den Ball mit Effet ins gegnerische Tor \u2013 mitten durch Power-ups und pures Chaos. Leicht zu lernen, schwer zu meistern \u2013 und garantiert nichts zum Stillsitzen!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrfriends.org/produkte/bbb-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vrfriends.org/produkte/bbb-eula/", "publisher_name": "VR Friends GbR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vrfriends.org/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_U